nt\" is used. |","table":"table-0"},"1477":{"id":"/cube/number-stepper-11","page_id":"/cube/number-stepper","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cube/number-stepper#属性","content":"| 属性             | 类型       | 必填  | 默认  | 说明                                |\n| -------------- | -------- | --- | --- | --------------------------------- |\n| `defaultValue` | `number` | 否   | `—` | The default value (uncontrolled). |","table":"table-0"},"1478":{"id":"/cube/number-stepper-12","page_id":"/cube/number-stepper","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cube/number-stepper#属性","content":"| 属性                   | 类型       | 必填  | 默认  | 说明                                                                                                       |\n| -------------------- | -------- | --- | --- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `incrementAriaLabel` | `string` | 否   | `—` | A custom aria-label for the increment button. If not provided, the localized string \"Increment\" is used. |","table":"table-0"},"1479":{"id":"/cube/number-stepper-13","page_id":"/cube/number-stepper","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cube/number-stepper#属性","content":"| 属性           | 类型        | 必填  | 默认  | 说明                             |\n| ------------ | --------- | --- | --- | ------------------------------ |\n| `isDisabled` | `boolean` | 否   | `—` | Whether the input is disabled. |","table":"table-0"},"1480":{"id":"/cube/number-stepper-14","page_id":"/cube/number-stepper","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cube/number-stepper#属性","content":"| 属性          | 类型        | 必填  | 默认  | 说明                                  |\n| ----------- | --------- | --- | --- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `isInvalid` | `boolean` | 否   | `—` | Whether the input value is invalid. |","table":"table-0"},"1481":{"id":"/cube/number-stepper-15","page_id":"/cube/number-stepper","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/cube/number-stepper#属性","content":"| 属性           | 类型     